{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yomojomo of Didi and Jeong Tae-woong's Life in Korea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, this is Didi."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, this is Jeong Tae-woong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yomojomo of Life in Korea is a podcast where two people living in Korea talk about the various aspects of life in Korea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What topic should we talk about today?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today's topic is a Taiwan travel edition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For a moment I thought it was travel, but yes, Taiwan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like we decided on Taiwan because you said there was an interesting story to tell."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's listen as we go along."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, sounds good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before we start the podcast, Teacher Tae-woong, All Things Korean hasn't surpassed 10,000 subscribers yet?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're not too concerned about it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Comprehensible Input Korean surpassed 30,000 subscribers, congratulations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You worked hard on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's not something I'm concerned about, actually."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think I've ever seen it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's at 10,000 subscribers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I congratulated you on everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back when I was doing Comprehensible Input Korean, I think I did something at 1,000 subscribers and then at 10,000 subscribers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really? Like some kind of celebration live stream or video?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think at the 10,000 subscriber milestone I did something like \"ask me anything.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh right, I've seen that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ask me anything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After doing that, I realized it wasn't really a big deal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, it's definitely a big deal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just imagine those 10,000 people right in front of you. That's a huge number."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I might be too pessimistic, and if you actually gathered all those 10,000 people together..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They won't gather."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some people would drop out saying they have to go to a friend's wedding, and others would say they can't come because they have too much schoolwork."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's no reason for them to gather in the first place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, I don't think they'd all be able to gather like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then you lose motivation, don't you? If you think like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now the only thing I can trust is myself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What kind of conclusion is that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just keep working hard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm the only one here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's nice. There's nothing to shake you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. Actually, I do get shaken by myself quite a bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The person who gets shaken the most."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's talk about the podcast some other time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today we want to talk about Taiwan. How many times have you been to Taiwan, Teacher Tae-woong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've only been once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Me too, just once. When did you go?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's been a while, I think it was about 7 or 8 years ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's similar to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I think it was around that time for me too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I went in 2016."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "2016?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Me too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When did you go? What month?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't remember what month, but it was summer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was summer? Mine was winter. I must have gone first then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's interesting. We went around the same time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Was Taiwan trendy back then? How did you end up going to Taiwan?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How should I put it? I was working at a company."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like that kind of lifestyle didn't really suit me much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You felt that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did feel it. So I always wanted to take a vacation somewhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think I was there for about 10 months."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back then I'd take a short day off on Friday and travel from Thursday evening to Sunday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or I'd take a half day on Friday and travel from Friday evening to Sunday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I traveled abroad pretty frequently like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While working at a company? That's not easy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there are nearby countries, you know. Actually there are only two. Japan and Taiwan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back then I went to Japan several times and went to Taiwan once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But since they're close by. And the more I traveled like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "instead of vacation periods or holidays, I could find relatively cheap flight tickets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if I looked diligently enough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. So it wasn't like I decided to travel and then went,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was sudden?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I saw a cheap flight that matched a Friday-Saturday-Sunday schedule,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd book that first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know. I know. I know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then go and come back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That way I traveled quite nicely and came back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So one day you found cheap Taiwan flight tickets and went, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you remember? Around 100,000 won? Around 200,000 won?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. It was late 100,000 won range?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How many hours is it from Korea to Taiwan?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it about two and a half hours?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't remember now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. I think it was about that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I looked into it recently because I want to go to Taiwan again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back then, did you usually go on overseas trips alone?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I went alone every time back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know what they call a wandering spirit?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had that pretty strongly back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I constantly wanted to go out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And wanted to wander around and such."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I heard people talk about that a lot back then too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you went for about three nights and four days?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it was two nights and three days back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tae-woong, when you travel, how much do you plan ahead?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I only plan up to the things I absolutely must see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Must see?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Things like must go, must eat?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Must eat. These are things I absolutely have to do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Just like one thing per day?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I plan roughly that much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the rest I figure out as I go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You think things through gradually as you go. I think I'm similar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423000,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's something fun about arriving and thinking \"what should I do tomorrow\" and making plans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is that fun?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. For me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is the fun in thinking \"what should I do tomorrow\"?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's how it is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really? At first I used to travel like that too,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but gradually I started planning more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How do I put it—you need time to think about what you're going to do tomorrow, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when you travel, time is really limited and you have to play in a short window."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At some point, I started to feel like I was wasting that time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now I prefer to plan things out a bit more before I go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That makes sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. And one of the downsides of planning so loosely like that is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can't do certain things that require advance reservations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when I was younger, I used to travel really spontaneously like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. And the fun thing is, certain things really do require reservations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Popular places and things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you have to make wise choices."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back then, did you travel without much of a plan?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Back then, what I liked was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the reason I liked it was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I was traveling alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the first day, hotels were expensive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I always stayed at guesthouses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then at the guesthouse, besides the sleeping area, there's a space where you can buy food and eat,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like a lounge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. There's a lounge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So on the first day, I'd go and sit in that lounge in the evening,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "open my notebook and turn on my phone and make a plan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then I could see other travelers there too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So then you could exchange a few words."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where are you from?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That way I'd communicate in English"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and strike up conversations with foreign friends who had really different backgrounds from me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's what was fun about it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. It was really fun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I've only done that once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had that exact kind of fantasy back then,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meeting foreigners at a guesthouse or lounge and chatting—I had that fantasy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I went on a solo trip to Japan,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and while staying at a guesthouse there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600460,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I remember talking with the host Didi in the lounge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603500,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was in the lounge, but no matter how long I waited, not many people came."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610360,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was a lonely lounge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613360,
    "dDurationMs": 2699,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. You have to be lucky for that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616059,
    "dDurationMs": 3021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The timing has to be good, and you have to be lucky."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619500,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not something you can control on your own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623719,
    "dDurationMs": 4321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you meet a lot of people like that, Teacher Tae-woong? In Taiwan?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628299,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Taiwan, that kind of way..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634299,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I've said hello a few times,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 638299,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I don't think I met people like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641799,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So talking a lot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644799,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "traveling together or exchanging contact information—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648299,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that kind of thing didn't happen at the guesthouse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653799,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655299,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656560,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you have any memories left from Taiwan?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660060,
    "dDurationMs": 4999,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how many days did you spend in Taiwan, Didi?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666059,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it was four nights and five days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669059,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Taipei?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670059,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I went to Taipei, and also to Taichung."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673059,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have a friend whose mother is Taiwanese and father is Korean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682820,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I went along with that friend,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685820,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and my maternal uncle and relatives there drove me around,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 691820,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "showed me good restaurants, and since I went without any plans,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694820,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had a really fulfilling trip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697820,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was so good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698820,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was the best."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699820,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I have really good memories of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702820,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was really the best trip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704820,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It really was the best. A local guide."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 709820,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm jealous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712820,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I think of Taiwan, the first thing that comes to mind is that the food was really delicious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 719820,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, what kinds of things?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722820,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There were so many,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724820,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but first of all, there are night markets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727820,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I ate everything sold at the night market until my stomach was full."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734820,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What did I eat? Fried butter crumble, you know, crumble with butter in it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738820,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was really delicious too,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741580,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there's that famous cube steak with potatoes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744580,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I ate that too, and I really love tripe noodle soup,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749580,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I enjoyed eating tripe noodle soup."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755580,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Didn't you try chicken wing fried rice?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 758580,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not sure about chicken wing fried rice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761580,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but there's a place at the night market that sells various skewers and things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766580,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've tried chicken wing skewers and fried chicken wings like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 771580,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was delicious too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773580,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Teacher Tae-woong, was that the most delicious for you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779580,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can't really pick the most delicious one,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 782580,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because there were so many?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783580,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, because there were so many."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 785580,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No. Other than that, there's beef noodle soup."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 789580,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's noodles with big chunks of beef in it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795580,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. Beef noodle soup was delicious too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 798339,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The chicken wing fried rice I mentioned"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801339,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think they sold it at the night market."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804339,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really? What restaurant did you eat it at?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 806339,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It wasn't a restaurant, it was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809339,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know there's a railway scenic spot?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814339,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, yes. Jiufen?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816339,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is that right? The one where you release lanterns?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818339,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, that's right. The scenic spot where you release lanterns."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821100,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822100,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At that scenic spot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825100,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there was a small food cart,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829100,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or like a cart where they sell things in small portions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834100,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's like street food?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 836100,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838100,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I still regret not buying two of them back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843100,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845100,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Street food seems really delicious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847100,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 848860,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Especially when you eat it on the street, it's often when you're hungry,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 851860,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it tastes even better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 854860,
    "dDurationMs": 1999,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you eat it right away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 856859,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858859,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859859,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's strong. The flavor is very strong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862859,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Taiwan was a place where I felt every single day that my stomach could be this full,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 867859,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "throughout my trip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 871859,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the desserts were delicious too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 874619,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For reference, I've also felt that kind of place in one location."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 880619,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Somewhere other than here?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 881619,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Turkey. Turkey."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 883619,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, Turkey!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885619,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Turkey has a really epic story from my life, so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 889619,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I need to visit Turkey too. Through this episode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 893619,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I get the chance next time, I'll share more details about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 897619,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sounds good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 899380,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And by the way, the core story of that experience"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905380,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is already on my podcast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 908380,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 909380,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910380,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So all of Tae-woong's true fans would know that story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 913380,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914380,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916380,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway, back to Taiwan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 917380,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. So coming back to it, for me it was a trip where I ate a lot of delicious food"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922380,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and traveled comfortably following friends and relatives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 927380,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How was it for you, Teacher Tae-woong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 929380,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did everything by myself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 935380,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it was fun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 937380,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm not sure if it's just something Koreans do,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 943380,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but when you go to Taipei, there's something called a \"national rule,\" right? A national-level rule?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950380,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Something you have to do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951380,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. There's a national rule tour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955380,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "101?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 957380,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958380,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Taipei 101. That building, the skyscraper. It's 101 stories tall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 962380,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Isn't that it? I went there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964380,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah. Ah. Ah. I was thinking about going there but didn't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 967380,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968380,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. There's something called the \"Yes Jinji tour.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 974380,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What that is, is taking the first letters of the names of four tourist attractions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979380,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make the Yes Jinji tour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982380,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yehliu, Shifen, Jin... Jin... Ah, what was Jin again?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 989380,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, Ji... what did you call it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 991380,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, Jinji, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 993380,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
